# Butler Routes - Moonglade recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The 8 year-round vendor-sold recipes on the Moonglade map (zone 1450),
# verified against the local Forever game data: 6 Tailoring patterns from
# Darnall and Lorelae Wintersong, 2 Enchanting formulae from Lorelae
# Wintersong (see the Moonglade census companions answer; this is the
# micro-round it deferred). Both vendors are neutral and spawn only in
# Moonglade. No seasonal stock ships (Lunar Festival content stays out per
# the core census). Each step is gated to its profession; every goal is a
# buy and optional. No stock-class flag exists in the data, so nothing is
# marked limited. No accept/turnin lines anywhere.
guide butler-routes-completionist/moonglade-recipes
title Moonglade - Recipes
levels 10-52
zone Moonglade
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords moonglade, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Tailoring - Moonglade (Darnall)

  zone map 1450

  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 7940 -- Darnall (51.47, 33.25)
  buy 14469 "Pattern: Runecloth Robe"
  buy 14472 "Pattern: Runecloth Cloak"
  buy 14488 "Pattern: Runecloth Boots"
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag"
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Tailoring - Moonglade (Lorelae Wintersong)

  zone map 1450

  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 12022 -- Lorelae Wintersong (48.24, 40.14)
  buy 14483 "Pattern: Felcloth Pants"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Enchanting - Moonglade (Lorelae Wintersong)

  zone map 1450

  when skill Enchanting 1

  vendor 12022 -- Lorelae Wintersong (48.24, 40.14)
  buy 16224 "Formula: Enchant Cloak - Superior Defense"
  buy 16243 "Formula: Runed Arcanite Rod"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
